WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
[No sound] Why big cats need guardians

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Lions now live in a much smaller area
than they once did.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
About 22,000 to 25,000 are left in Africa,
and about 670 in India.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Tigers are endangered.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Only about 3,700 to 5,600
live in the wild.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Leopards live in more than 70 countries,

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
but they are disappearing
from many places.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
You can help: learn, share,
and volunteer with us.
